    <!-- Vanilla stim users: REPLACE their stim ability/button slots with the WoLU clone by
         index (global — but safe: vanilla stim was requirement-gated and no mission ever
         grants the tech to AI players, and the clone is gated on our flag upgrade which
         only the human player receives). Runtime per-player link swaps proved to be
         silent no-ops, so this must live in XML. -->
    <!-- TEMPORARILY REVERTED to vanilla stim: the clone ability casts nothing (manual
         press dead in game) — a schema bug in Stimpack's ability/effect chain.
         Re-enable these index-overrides once the clone is rebuilt from a verbatim
         Blizzard reference (Nova Covert Ops stim in campaigncommon/novastoryassets). -->

    <!-- AP port: Firebats get Stimpack (vanilla campaign firebats have none). The button is
